<note id="_4fd243a0-f4cf-e209-6b2d-4c5639780309" type="boilerplate"><p id="_9c14b608-12e3-aff3-becf-e192575aed54">Changes to this Product Specification are coordinated by the IHO Nautical
Information Provision Working Group (NIPWG). New editions will be
made available via the IHO web site. Maintenance of the Product Specification
shall conform to IHO Technical Resolution 2/2007 (revised 2010).</p>
</note>

