1.1.0,
International Hydrographic Organization</formattedref><docnumber>123 Annex A</docnumber><title>S-123 — Annex A: Data Classification and Encoding Guide</title><docidentifier>IHO S-123 Annex A</docidentifier><docidentifier type="repository">current-metanorma-collection/IHO S-123 Annex A</docidentifier><contributor>
  <role type="author"/>
