<td id="_0d49e01d-8bb9-55ca-1390-296a6184b032" valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr id="_fcea70bb-1650-95d2-8757-3eb01824df9a"><td id="_2a30b213-96ac-6515-ba85-91a2aa2e2925" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
<td id="_bf7eeb41-2815-13f7-3b01-cf4c40ad0a93" valign="top" align="left">editionNumber</td>
<td id="_15f23b75-cce2-e9cb-d043-c0ed135a047a" valign="top" align="left">The edition number of the dataset</td>
<td id="_ce0f41fc-88c6-99fb-11f4-3edbb8b84b5e" valign="top" align="left"><strong>1</strong></td>
<td id="_187499a1-cd92-5476-0c85-3b43c4a42c1d" valign="top" align="left">Integer</td>
<td id="_d8aab25a-fa10-be16-40d4-8db591a294c9" valign="top" align="left">When a dataset is initially created, the Edition number 1 is assigned to it. The Edition number is increased by 1 at each New Edition. Edition number remains the same for update and re-issue.0..1 multiplicity in S-100 restricted to 1 in S-123</td>
</tr><tr id="_be918124-feea-fdad-47bf-5f1be1ace35d"><td id="_7a4b7d90-87bb-a1fb-eb48-42699829a9f5" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
