<td id="_16f8997f-6957-706f-8ea4-1a9f2f1e0296" valign="top" align="left">Update number 0 is assigned to a new dataset0..1 multiplicity in S-100 restricted to 1 in S-123</td>
</tr><tr id="_aa18b7f8-59ae-fae5-5d1e-6e28d4ee6d1e"><td id="_e9c8ca05-0237-028f-ab8f-f8bcce20cdc3" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
<td id="_ce0ca112-1b3f-2cd9-7c16-2199c0cc5253" valign="top" align="left">updateApplicationDate</td>
<td id="_f704f972-0fb2-534f-b81e-5bccd947d752" valign="top" align="left">This date is only used for the base cell files (that is new data set, re-issue and new edition), not update cell files. All updates dated on or before this date must have been applied by the producer</td>
<td id="_b8537d28-1b42-15f5-f00f-8da87a21b611" valign="top" align="left">0..1</td>
<td id="_3fba241d-b924-70cd-9679-3bdfaed08a29" valign="top" align="left">Date</td>
<td id="_d898d00c-bde1-ba35-a17f-9a1d8f3d2edf" valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr id="_5e38edf9-4d26-f7ce-bef5-a75aece5669f"><td id="_72e10679-77f5-403a-d24c-95aa2a5de732" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
