<td id="_4c5b494b-6144-5a75-d948-156b499c4bc3" valign="top" align="left">Reference back to the datasetID</td>
<td id="_edcccca0-c886-36c9-2cf5-67e9f8203fe5" valign="top" align="left">0..1</td>
<td id="_6a238618-f5d8-e791-2710-218c2a5120fd" valign="top" align="left">URN</td>
<td id="_f51786f0-651e-bc13-aec5-45b69afacc79" valign="top" align="left">Update metadata refers to the datasetIDof the dataset metadata. This is used if and only if the dataset is an updateThe URN must be an MRN</td>
</tr><tr id="_604bcf45-efcf-4334-52a9-2785ee8cfb5b"><td id="_ee58e299-16f3-e217-c7ca-79df8b4af1e1" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
