<td id="_dadad1ee-b2f0-e032-c133-a42ac50aa9c1" valign="top" align="left">Date on which the data was made available by the data producer</td>
<td id="_0775b8b8-60ec-a1e2-8d7e-922d6a23146a" valign="top" align="left">1</td>
