<td id="_64766fed-2a25-e185-5857-59a04d5b5d10" valign="top" align="left">The S-100 datatype Time</td>
</tr><tr id="_a535a52a-8d92-1302-bb29-3b8bd44463af"><td id="_d22e7657-8f2d-6874-e903-503f786de1f4" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
