<td id="_e59a0db3-4daf-135e-1b07-019e65f738bc" valign="top" align="left">The version number of the Product Specification</td>
<td id="_b34f020c-071f-f584-a4af-315a68bdd8c6" valign="top" align="left"><strong>1</strong></td>
<td id="_0c3c77f2-e75b-1ef9-3877-aaf97b0ed14c" valign="top" align="left">CharacterString</td>
<td id="_51ff7c42-e60b-619a-3949-0aaf1c1900d9" valign="top" align="left">TR 2/2007 specifies versioning of Product Specifications</td>
</tr><tr id="_673ecc07-7862-5bad-3907-e282118bfa3c"><td id="_c6ee7e02-9d88-3b42-4c49-a6fbc66c4873" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
