<td id="_480d1028-187f-202d-0886-73a180c97964" valign="top" align="left">The value resulting from application of digitalSignatureReferenceImplemented as the digital signature format specified in <eref type="inline" bibitemid="IHO_S_100" citeas="S-100"><localityStack><locality type="part"><referenceFrom>15</referenceFrom></locality></localityStack></eref></td>
