<td id="_2930ee34-99bf-6364-7e55-223714c9a319" valign="top" align="left">In absence of defaultLocale the language is English in UTF-8A support file is expected to use only one as locale. Additional support files can be created for other locales.</td>
</tr><tr id="_d49da94f-5093-0bd3-319e-b3bdb4dba10e"><td id="_848bc771-a9f9-4c81-b6d0-eb5de1e16604" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
