<td id="_81210978-85fe-b762-7dc6-70f51f4ec93b" valign="top" align="left">CharacterString</td>
<td id="_561f7cd7-b477-7c70-402d-815cd9f9ac2c" valign="top" align="left">Conventions for identifiers are detailed in <eref type="inline" bibitemid="IHO_S_100" citeas="S-100"><localityStack><locality type="part"><referenceFrom>15</referenceFrom></locality></localityStack></eref>. S-100 allows file URI, digital signature or cryptographic hash checksums to be used</td>
</tr><tr id="_2796e5c7-cf24-b967-52fe-311d56e4902b"><td id="_a055b996-3f99-c625-33bd-2e3df441b37b" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
