<td id="_05454401-7bb0-cd21-2af2-29547c363c23" valign="top" align="left">The values must be one of the following: <em>2</em> new edition<br/> <em>5</em> cancellation<br/> Default is new edition</td>
</tr><tr id="_44d9162d-ca2e-debe-718e-05411b2623b8"><td id="_925f2d83-b4d3-7d2f-7fd1-47a184e08f66" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
