<tbody><tr id="_48930165-ed02-e731-3bd7-2a7abff39577"><td id="_ea7763ce-1077-ad06-37f5-0e7bd99aa4cc" valign="top" align="left">Class</td>
<td id="_0b4ab323-bafb-52da-3223-7401967c0dcd" valign="top" align="left">EX_GeographicBoundingBox</td>
<td id="_cec8f197-e6a2-4dc0-156e-d8efe7b19cf3" valign="top" align="left">geographic position of the dataset</td>
<td id="_f203dcb7-f090-6a3e-5ec2-d3ed1bcf751b" valign="top" align="left">-</td>
<td id="_34e446b2-7c7f-7587-9274-ff91650d9ba2" valign="top" align="left">-</td>
<td id="_3db72e33-c531-5c27-e26f-a3db8aecc700" valign="top" align="left">Defined in ISO 19115-1: geographic position of the resource</td>
</tr><tr id="_7e1fad5a-7e1d-4a69-4e34-aaf8f7afd256"><td id="_ac606349-45a3-eff5-f33e-a28a29cd8115" valign="top" align="left">Attribute</td>
<td id="_0565d5dc-22e8-1913-9d06-74e4d5cfad2d" valign="top" align="left">westBoundLongitude</td>
<td id="_be7b4bd4-8c5a-0e93-d643-b8ae37b22299" valign="top" align="left">western-most coordinate of the limit of the dataset extent, expressed in longitude in decimal degrees (positive east)</td>
<td id="_c304d9fa-1490-efbc-df92-85435d00e2c7" valign="top" align="left">1</td>
