</clause>
</clause>

<clause id="_14c2659e-7b76-610f-9db2-c3a37b052ef2" anchor="sec_10.3" obligation="normative">
<title id="_4a31d46e-82cd-002f-31ba-5423f76a2927">Language</title>
<p id="_4a5140fc-53b3-96bb-cb99-2a1d70b45adc">The exchange language must be English. Other languages may be used as a supplementary option. National geographic names can be left in their original national language using the complex attribute <strong>feature name</strong>.</p>

<p id="_86a534bc-49de-47a9-e64a-d61b64dcee07">Character strings must be encoded using the character set defined in  <eref type="inline" bibitemid="ISO_10646_1" citeas="ISO/IEC 10646-1:2000"/>, in Unicode Transformation Format-8 (UTF-8). A BOM (byte order mark) must not be used.</p>
</clause>
</clause>
</sections>
</metanorma>
